# World layers: the hidden lore chains that run through the props of e1_layers, q_layers, e3_layers and e4_layers
# (design/WORLD-LAYERS.md section 6). World-layers pass, 2026-10-23. Nothing here is shown to the player; the game never
# states what a chain means. One game plays all five eras, so a one-run route can cross them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the goat looking back
@chain w.goat
name: The goat that looks back
route: one-run | w.lore.goat_table, w.lore.goat_stair, w.lore.goat_stencil
route: one-run | w.lore.goat_table, w.lore.goat_cell, w.lore.goat_stair

@lore w.lore.goat_table
chain: w.goat
layer: surface
where: prop q.haldane_table new
about: The goat carved low on the new table's leg, its head turned back over its shoulder.

@lore w.lore.goat_cell
chain: w.goat
layer: hidden
where: prop q.cell_goat fresh
requires: class militia
requires: choice has(q.tomas_held)
about: The same goat, freshly scratched low on the end cell's wall at the height of a boy sitting on the bench.

@lore w.lore.goat_stair
chain: w.goat
layer: surface
where: prop q.stair_goat
about: A chalk goat at a child's height by the Mott house back room, scrubbed to its legs.

@lore w.lore.goat_stencil
chain: w.goat
layer: surface
where: prop q.goat_stencil
about: The town's goat: a stencil, head down and facing forward, used to mark the Row.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the barless seven
@chain w.hand
name: Walter's black finger
# the weighted-devices pass (2026-10-23): the barless seven was a thing to read; Walter's forefinger, black with ink to
# the second knuckle since he was a boy, is a thing you see on a hand: the goat he chalks on the shut barn in era 1, the
# ink prints on the rim of the bucket at the Sholls' door in era 3, the rag he wipes it on
route: one-run | w.lore.hand_slips, w.lore.hand_bill, w.lore.hand_blotter
route: one-run | w.lore.hand_slips, w.lore.hand_bill

@lore w.lore.hand_slips
chain: w.hand
layer: surface
where: prop q.copy_slips counter
about: Walter Mott's black forefinger chalking the goat on the shut end barn on census night, head down.

@lore w.lore.hand_bill
chain: w.hand
layer: surface
where: prop q.well_handbill
about: The bucket of spring water at the Sholls' door with a rat in it, and black finger marks on its rim.

@lore w.lore.hand_blotter
chain: w.hand
layer: deep
where: prop q.walters_blotter close
requires: class inspector
about: Walter's ink rag in the office drawer, black where a forefinger has been wiped on it for forty years. Whose hand put the rat in the bucket stays open.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the tide line
@chain w.water
name: The same water
# the Brack kitchen is the Militia line's, the slips the Inspector line's
route: two-classes | w.lore.tide, w.lore.unfit
# each class meets the same water from its own side in one run (no gate the player cannot see)
route: one-run | w.lore.tide
route: one-run | w.lore.unfit

@lore w.lore.tide
chain: w.water
layer: surface
where: prop q.tide_line
about: The flood line round the Brack kitchen on Mill Street, at the height of the table, and new plaster under it. The Bracks stayed.

@lore w.lore.unfit
chain: w.water
layer: deep
where: prop q.unfit_slips close
requires: class inspector
about: The ring of Mill Street keys rusted to the flood line on the office hook, and the Brack key the only one gone.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- faces
@chain w.faces
name: A long careful face
route: one-run | w.lore.beam, w.lore.anni_wedding, w.lore.ned_young
# the Militia line sees the same face across the scale on the square, and the girl's at the post
route: one-run | w.lore.ned_scale, w.lore.anni_wedding

@lore w.lore.beam
chain: w.faces
layer: hidden
where: prop q.loft_beam cut
requires: class inspector
about: B.C. cut in the loft's purlin three springs before the census, and the letters beside it scraped off.

@lore w.lore.anni_wedding
chain: w.faces
layer: surface
where: prop q.anni_wedding
about: Anni at her wedding on the Mott house steps: a long, careful face, nothing like Oren's or Ilo's.

@lore w.lore.ned_scale
chain: w.faces
layer: deep
where: node q.office.will
requires: class militia
about: Across the scale on the square, Ned Furrowe's long careful face, the same as the Haldane girl's at the post.

@lore w.lore.ned_young
chain: w.faces
layer: deep
where: prop q.ned_photo
requires: class inspector
about: Ned at twenty-seven in the Furrowe hall: a long, careful face.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the ring
@chain w.thread
name: Leave it
# Will's own words reach the Inspector on the Crown's steps; the Militia line is Will at the corner, and the ring in his
# locker eight years on is the thread he picked up off the clay
route: one-run | w.lore.leave_it, w.lore.ring
route: one-run | w.lore.leave_it, w.lore.spool

@lore w.lore.leave_it
chain: w.thread
layer: deep
where: node q.coda.corner
where: node q.cells.corner
about: The thread at the corner past the gap: Gedge wanted it off him, and Will's hand over the boy's wrist, or the thread cut and in Will's pocket.

@lore w.lore.ring
chain: w.thread
layer: hidden
where: prop q.will_locker ring
requires: class militia
requires: choice has(q.tomas_held)
about: A plaited ring of blue thread, cut through, on the hook in Will's locker eight years on; it weighs nothing in the palm.

@lore w.lore.spool
chain: w.thread
layer: surface
where: prop q.haldane_thread
about: The spare blue wool on its peg by the Haldanes' stove, not much left on it; or Anni's thread in a loop on the shelf by her bowl.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the name
@chain w.name
name: The name they gave him
# the weighted-devices pass: the misspelt name was a thing to read; now it is said, to faces, by men who did not
# bother with it: Haldane from Furrowe at the barn door in era 1, Halden from the gate at the far bank in era 3
route: one-run | w.lore.name_given, w.lore.long_service

@lore w.lore.name_given
chain: w.name
layer: surface
where: node e1.census.name
about: Census night at the end barn: the name Ilo is given at the door because the man with the round to do will not take his own.

@lore w.lore.long_service
chain: w.name
layer: surface
where: prop q.long_service
about: Aaron's long-service truncheon, heavy with lead, given to a man the works and the force called Halden, and nobody putting them right.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the Row's lights
@chain w.meter
name: No lights
route: one-run | w.lore.meter_card, w.lore.report

@lore w.lore.meter_card
chain: w.meter
layer: surface
where: prop q.meter_card
about: Teo's red torch in the tin at Mira's, the switch rusted on: the Row's lights cut off before the fire.

@lore w.lore.report
chain: w.meter
layer: deep
where: prop q.fire_report typed
about: The bag on the sergeant's desk with the bottle neck in it, and "electrical" said out loud over it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the sixth spoon
@chain w.spoon
name: The sixth spoon
route: one-run | w.lore.spoon_jar
# a later run, after one that found where Tomas lies
route: across-runs | w.lore.spoon_back

@lore w.lore.spoon_jar
chain: w.spoon
layer: surface
where: prop q.carved_spoons jar
about: Five of Ilo's spoons in a jar wide enough for six.

@lore w.lore.spoon_back
chain: w.spoon
layer: hidden
where: prop q.carved_spoons yellow
requires: prior q.fact.corner
about: On a later run, one spoon back by Joss's rack, its bowl stained yellow with the corner's clay.
